Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,We recently saw an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:03.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,attack that was across
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:04.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,probably 3,000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:06.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,4,000 accounts
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.51,0:00:08.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,100,000 requests all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:11.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,within 100 milliseconds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:12.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,So for context
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:14.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,we stop like inference
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.31,0:00:16.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,abuse and like token
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:16.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:18.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,And this person had been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:18.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,sitting on these
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:19.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,accounts for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:20.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some were bought up from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.83,0:00:22.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,the underground markets
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.41,0:00:23.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,some were probably spun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:24.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,up from automation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:26.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,An attack can now be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:27.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,if they just want a few
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.91,0:00:28.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,things to slip through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:30.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,it might be a million
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,requests across a large
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:33.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,number of accounts all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:34.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,at once.
